        "title": "Masterclass: Landscape Photography Shoots",
        "duration": "18 lessons",
        "desc": "The course begins with the basics of finding great locations for shooting landscapes and progresses to cover everything you need to know about capturing great landscape photographs — including framing, composition, camera settings, where to stand, and visualising shots and more."
      },
      {
        "title": "Ultimate Guide to Night Sky Photography",
        "duration": "12 lessons",
        "desc": "Everything there is to know about shooting astrophotography — from the best settings to use, tripods and equipment, where to shoot, and how to create beautiful composite images in post. Take your night-sky photography to the next level."
      },
      {
        "title": "The Art of Editing for Landscapes",
        "duration": "15 lessons",
        "desc": "A complete, repeatable editing workflow: building luminosity masks, color grading for mood, dodging and burning, and finishing a print-ready file that holds up at gallery scale."
      }
    ]
  },
